The printed name of s_4 is "chair".
Understand "chair" as s_4.
The s_4 is in r_6.
The description of s_5 is "The table is shaky.".
The printed name of s_5 is "table".
Understand "table" as s_5.
The s_5 is in r_17.
The description of s_6 is "The shelf is solidly built.".
The printed name of s_6 is "shelf".
Understand "shelf" as s_6.
The s_6 is in r_3.
The description of s_7 is "The plate is stable.".
The printed name of s_7 is "plate".
Understand "plate" as s_7.
The s_7 is in r_7.
The description of s_8 is "The counter is wobbly.".
The printed name of s_8 is "counter".
Understand "counter" as s_8.
The s_8 is in r_7.
